+ *     macro's core ID says 2.1): no SoundWire mic clock dividers anywhere (va_macro_init() and the TX macro's
+ *     SWR_MIC_CTL writes are 2.0/2.1 only), the "TX SMIC MUX" inputs are ADC0..3 and SWR_DMIC0..7 (smic_mux_text),
