+ * into decimator 0 of the TX macro ("TX DEC0 MUX" SWR_MIC, "TX SMIC MUX0" ADC0: bolero's ADC0 is the codec's ADC1,
+ * "TX SWR_ADC0" <- "ADC1_OUTPUT" in the tree's routing), out of it through the codec DMA interface
